Z||000003||maryjane||06-30-2001||09:56 PM||||Does the solenoid click when you try to start<BR>it or nothing at all? Can you hear the fuel pump running? If it clicks but doesn't turn over,probably the starter or solenoid. If nothing at all, check battery connections and<BR>switches mentioned in above posts.<P>------------------<BR>84 SE 2.5<BR>not slow not fast-just halfast||||reg||1
